  abstract: >-
    v10 turns the v9 implementation contract into a single computable scalar
    Lambda_10 = sum_k L_k * prod_j 1[j_k]; auditClosed iff closure ratio = 1.
    No new physical L-term; the operator is a meta-invariant on the existing
    family and is strictly inert in the all-operational limit.
